    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium proposes a solution that provides intelligent assistance to hospital staff in hospital staff clinical and administrative activities. a solution that provides intelligent assistance to hospital staff in their clinical and administrative activities integrates with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), supporting health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR. a solution that provides intelligent assistance to hospital staff in their clinical and administrative activities provides drafting assistance for medical and administrative documents, support for handling dossiers, admissions, coding, medico-social pathways, and continuity of care between professionals and services." ;
