    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company's has experience in managing projects for public sector clients, including a regional council and a mutual health insurer, with durations ranging from 9 months. our company's uses a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement, which includes phases such as Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run." ;
